{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 This package Huamnizes Kontakt #0016 Host parameter (should be assigned to Tune)\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 An ImGui-based utility for adjusting the track Media Playback Offset (positive and negative) of selected tracks. Works inside the MIDI Editor for the current MIDI item's track, or falls back to selected tracks in the Arrange view. Features a relative slider centered at 0ms, fine-tuning buttons, absolute offset reset, and a real-time list of track offsets.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
