{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 This package contains scripts for applying legato effects to MIDI notes. In midi Action List search for: MIDI_Toolbox_Advanced_Legato MIDI_Toolbox_Quick_Heal_Overlays MIDI_Toolbox_Quick_Legato MIDI_Toolbox_Quick_NonLegato MIDI_Toolbox_CC_Optimizer MIDI_Toolbox_Find_Parallels MIDI_Toolbox_Note_Mover\par}
}

